# Local Release Sync

Publishing is not complete until the matching GitHub Release has been synchronized
back to this workspace.

After a release is public:

1. Run `.\scripts\sync-latest-release.ps1`.
2. Confirm `release\CURRENT_VERSION` equals `src\PlotJuggler\STUDIO_VERSION`.
3. Confirm `release\portable\RosPlotJugglerStudio\bin\RosPlotJugglerStudio.exe` exists.
4. Report the local executable path to the user.

Do not commit `build/`, `install/`, `release/`, downloaded archives, or binaries.
